            "description": "# sam-us-zipcode-gecode\n\nsam-us-zipcode-gecode is a Python package for caching zip code information. It creates a cache of zip code information from a JSON file and stores it as individual files in a directory for faster access.\n\n## Installation\n\nYou can install sam-us-zipcode-gecode using pip:\n\n\n```bash\npip install sam-us-zipcode-gecode\n\n\n```\n\n\n## Usage\n\nHere's an example of how to use Zip Cache:\n\n```python\nfrom zip_cache import ZipCache\n\n\n# Get data for a zip code\ndata = cache.get_data(\"96105\")\nprint(data)\n```\n\n## Contributing\n\nPull requests are welcome. For major changes, please open an issue first\nto discuss what you would like to change.\n\nPlease make sure to update tests as appropriate.\n\n## License\n\n[MIT](https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/)\n",
